message: "If you use the Compliance Relay, please cite it as below."
title: "The Compliance Relay: a framework for estimating how much of a regulatory deadline reaches engineering teams"
version: "0.4.1"
date-released: "2026-11-02"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ravichandra"
    given-names: "Pooja"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - "EU Cyber Resilience Act"
  - "regulatory compliance"
  - "software supply chain security"
  - "planning"
  - "SBOM"
abstract: "The Compliance Relay is a generic, vendor-neutral framework, calculator, spreadsheet and worksheet for estimating the effective transition period of a regulation: the engineering time that remains after handoffs, waiting on guidance, planning cycles, dependencies, capacity limits and blocked periods."
